The input test dataset contains structures derived from the CSD entry with refcode AGAZIR. Rotational, translational, and chemical modifications were introduced using BIOVIA Materials Studio 2024 (https://www.3ds.com/products/biovia/materials-studio), and the reference complex was optimized using Gaussian 16 (https://gaussian.com/). The derived structural data are shared with permission from the Cambridge Crystallographic Data Centre (CCDC). These structures constitute third-party data and are not covered by the CDGA Tool license. Their use and redistribution remain subject to the applicable CCDC and software license terms.

